Hawi SoC uses v10.60 register definitions for PCIe Gen4 x1. Add the new
register offset headers for all four sub-blocks:

 - QSERDES-COM offsets
 - QSERDES TX/RX offsets
 - PCS offsets
 - PCS PCIe-specific offsets

